    "chunk_text": "5. Mr. M. H. Ananda Kumara, Attorney at Law\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'08'27Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 27.08.20252A\n\n4. I hereby authorize the Working Task Force to continuing the functions and to manage the affairs of Karate Do until the office bearers are elected at an Annual General Meeting held under the new Constitution of Karate Do.\n\nSunil Kumara Gamage (M.P.), Minister of Youth Affairs and Sports.\n\nAt Colombo,On this 27th day of August, 2025.\n\nEOG 08 - 0298\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
