    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'08'28PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 28.08.2025 1A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2451$38 \u2013 2025 wf.daia;= ui 28 jeks n%yiam;skaod \u2013 2025'08'28No. 2451/38 \u2013 THURSDAY, AUGUST 28, 2025\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A \u2013 G 045262 \u2013 09(08/2025)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nO\u0d8b\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b \u0d8e\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 38 (a)\n\nOrder No. 92 of 2025\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/09/2018/YA/426. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: AKU/LAN/06/LA100' BY virtue of the powers vested in me by the Order under Section 38 (a) of Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460), I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby direct the Acquiring O\ufb03 cer or any other o\ufb03 cer authorised by him referred to in Paragraph I of the Schedule to take Possesion of the land speci\ufb01 ed in the corresponding entry in Paragraph II of that Schedule. K.D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla,24th July, 2025.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nI. Acquiring O\ufb03 cer : Divisional Secretary, Akuressa.\n\nII. Description of the Land.\u2013 An allotment of land depicted in below name and extent in the Preliminary Plan No. F.V.P. 536 dated 25.02.2022 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Maramba in 363 A, Maramba North Grama Niladhari Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Akuressa in Matara District of Southern Province and bounded as:\n\n01. Lot No.543 \u2013 Maduru Mukalana \u2013 Extent:5.1680 Hectares North: Lot Nos.517 and 527; East: Lot Nos.527, 528 and 530; South: Lot Nos.530 and 8 and 8 \u00bd; West: Lot Nos.8 and 8 \u00bd and 517."
