    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2452$02 - 2025 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 01 jeks i`\u00ffod - 2025'09'01No. 2452/02 - MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 01, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotice under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\n1A - PG 7237 - 05 (09/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nLOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nBY virtue of the Powers vested in me under the Section (I) of 66 (C) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and the provision of Section 66 (G) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance, I do hereby informed that the name mentioned below was elected and declared by me as New Vice Chairman of Manmunai Pattu Pradeshiya Sabha in Batticaloa District with the Co - Chaired of Hon. Chairman of Pradeshiya Sabha, Manmunai Pattu in the Meeting held on the day of 29.08.2025 at 10.00 am at the Manmunai Pattu Pradeshiya Sabha Hall.\n\nA. L. M. Azmi, Commissioner of Local Government, Eastern Province. Office of the Department of Local Government,Eastern Province,Kanniya Road, Varothaya Nagar, Trincomalee,On this 01st day of September, 2025.\n\nDistrictName of Local AuthorityName of Vice Chairman\n\nBatticaloaManmunai Pattu Pradeshiya SabhaIlayathamby Muththukumar\n\nEOG 09 - 0014\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
