.A.B. Herath, 34/64, First lane, Fort Macdowall Mawatha, Matale to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration. Dr. ANIL JAYANTHA FERNANDO, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo,25th August, 2025.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/04/2023/256."
