    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2452/22 - 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc3 03 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.09.03\n\nNo. 2452/22 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 03, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7 Reference No.: 10/04/02/03/OCH/235. Land Ministry's Ref. No. : 4-3/5/2022/HW/175. I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following lands which are required for a public purpose. Description of the land to be acquired: Lot No. 1 to 12 (12 Lots) allotments in total extent of about 0.1224 Hectare,of land in Plan No. Cadastral Map No. 510837 ,Block No. 10, Sheet No. 1 and dated 30.12.2024 prepared by the Senior - Superintendent of Surveys of Gampaha District on behalf of the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Ihala Karagahamuna, situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 248, Ihala karagahamuna south, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Mahara in Gampaha District in the Western Province. 01. Lot No. 1 Name of land: -; Description: Road; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Cannot be found; Extent: 0.0059 Hectare."
