    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS Title Registration NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO PROPERTY OF INTESTATE REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT NO. 21 OF 1998 (SECTION 55) Reference the intestate property of late Mr. Mahumadu Abdul Nasari resides in the village of Kuruvikulam, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Puttalam, in the District of Puttalam. It is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or inyterest in the intestate property of the late Mr. Mahumadu Abdul Nasai in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 22nd September, 2025 stating his/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, exparte action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act. No. 21 of 1998. P. C. D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Madura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 15th August, 2025.\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 045294 - 04 (09/2025)\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2452/27 - 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc3 04 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u0dad\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.09.04\n\nNo. 2452/27 \u2013 THURSDAY, SEPTEMBER 04, 2025\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \