    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.10PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 10.09.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2453/17 \u2013 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 10 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.09.10No. 2453/17 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 10, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the servitude of land described below in Paragraph 1 is needed for a public purpose and is acquired under the provisions of the Land Acquisition Act. The description of the land of which servitude is acquired is given in the Paragraph 2.\n\n1. Description of the Servitude.\u2013 Acquisition of servitudes of alternative allotments of lands for the access road and to lay pipe lines of Pichchamal Watta Service Reservoir of Kundasale - Haragama Water Supply Project.\n\n2. Description of the Land.\u2013 An allotment of land described by the name and extent given below in the Advance Tracing No. Maha/MHN/2020/277 dated 28.10.2020, prepared by the Surveyor-General situated in the Village called Kirimetiya in the Grama Niladhari Division of\n\nGurudeniya - West (278) in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kandy Four Gravets and Gangawata Korale in the District of Kandy, Central Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Wettige Watta \u2013 Extent: 0.0767 Hectare North: Lot Nos. 218, 214 and 215 depicted in the C.M. 320301; East: Lot Nos. 215, 217, 216, 222, 221, 220, 227, 226, 225, 224, 223 and 14 depicted in the C.M. 320301; South: Road (Pradeshiya Sabha) and Lot Nos. 97 and 95 depicted in the C.M. 320301; West: Lot Nos. 95, 94, 93, 92, 218 and 214 depicted in the C.M. 320301."
