    "chunk_size_bytes": 2062,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2453/18 - 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc3 10 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.09.10\n\nNo. 2453/18 - WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 10, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired : An allotment of land in Total Extent of 7.9486 Hectares, depicted as Lot No. 506 in the sheet 21 supplement 23 in F.V.P. 23 dated 29.06.2020 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Dambagammana in the Grama Niladhari Division of Dombagammana of Nawadunkorale Meda Paththuwa Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Nivithigala in Ratnapura District of the Sabaragamuwa Province and morefully described as follows.\n\n01. Lot No. 506 Name of the Land: Dombagammana Estate; Description : Field No. 14; Original Claimant: Agalawatte Plantation Company; Extent: 7.9486 Hectares.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 045328 - 29 (09/2025)\n\nAll persons claiming title or other interest in the above land, or those authorized by their respective documents, should meet me at the Divisional Secretariat Nivithigala on 29th October, 2025 at 10.00 a.m.\n\nFurthermore, notify me in writing, in duplicate, by the 22nd October, 2025 of the nature of their rights in relation to those lands, the details of the grounds for requesting compensation for obtaining that land, the amount of compensation and how that amount was calculated."
