    "chunk_text": "Furthermore, notify me in writing, in duplicate, by the 22nd October, 2025 of the nature of their rights in relation to those lands, the details of the grounds for requesting compensation for obtaining that land, the amount of compensation and how that amount was calculated.\n\n2 A III \u0dba\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0dd2 \u0dc0 \u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dba \u0d9c \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba - 2025.09.10 Part III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 10.09.2025\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: B/E/03/01/02/DEHIGALA/ACQ 15.\n\nLand Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/15/2019/VE/374.\n\nIT is hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired : Allotments of land in Block No. 05, sheet No. 01 in the Cadastral Map No. 720165 dated 08th January 2025. Prepared by the Surveyor General situated in the Village of Karagahawela in Grama Niladhari Division of Karagahawela West in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Bibile in Monaragala District in Uva Province and bounded as follows:\n\nTotal Extent of Hectares - 1.7879 01. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Dehigolle Pathana; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: Land Rehabilitation Commission; Extent: 0.2586 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 02 Name of the Land: Dehigolle Pathana; Claimant: Government; Extent: 0.8378 Hectare.\n\n03. Lot No. 03 Name of the Land: Dehigolle Wathu Yaya; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: Madoldima Plantation Ltd; Extent: 0.4927 Hectare.\n\nSchedule 01 Allotments of land Cadastral Map No. 720165 Block No. 07 Sheet No. 01 and dated 08th January 2025."
