    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2453/21 - 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc3 10 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.09.10\n\nNo. 2453/21 - WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 10, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No. : \u0db8\u0dc4/\u0d89/\u0d85\u0dad\u0dca/378. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following lands which is required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired : Lot Nos. 01 and 02 in Sheet No. 01 of Ward No. 03 in the Cadastral Map 521416 in extent of 1.9266 Hectares prepared by the Surveyor General situated within the Grama Niladhari Division of 496 Kottawa South in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Maharagama in the Colombo District, Western Province and described as follows :\n\n01. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Galkandawela; Description : Paddy Field; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Not known; Extent: 1.7687 Hectares.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 045331 - 14 (09/2025)\n\n02. Lot No. 02 Name of the Land: Galkandawela; Description : Owita, An abandoned building; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Not known; Extent: 0.1579 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally or by agent duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Maharagama on the date of 29th October, 2025 at 10.00 a.m.\n\nFurthermore, hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 22nd October, 2025, the nature of their interests in the land/lands, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of the compensation and the details of the computation of such amount."
