    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2453/35 - 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc3 12 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.09.12 No. 2453/35 \u2013 FRIDAY, SEPTEMBER 12, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 045343 - 19 (09/2025)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7 My Reference No. : KIDS/LND/09/ACQ/07/05/01. I hereby give notice, under Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following Land/ Servitude for a public purpose. The public purpose: To Construct a gantry to improve the reliability and quality of electricity supply in Idangoda area. Description of the Land / Survitude to be acquired : Lot No. 01 in Extent of 0.0506 Hectare depicted in Polio No. 1 of F.V.P. No. 325 of Zone No. 04 of the Cadastral Map No. 620623 of the field sheet No. R/KRE/2024/38 prepared by Ratnapura Survey Superintendent situated in Matuwagala Grama Niladhari Division of Kiriella Divisional Secretary's Division of Uda Paththuwa of Kuruwita Korale of Ratnapura District of Sabaragamuwa Province."
