    "chunk_text": "THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7 My Reference No. : KIDS/LND/09/ACQ/07/05/01. I hereby give notice, under Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following Land/ Servitude for a public purpose. The public purpose: To Construct a gantry to improve the reliability and quality of electricity supply in Idangoda area. Description of the Land / Survitude to be acquired : Lot No. 01 in Extent of 0.0506 Hectare depicted in Polio No. 1 of F.V.P. No. 325 of Zone No. 04 of the Cadastral Map No. 620623 of the field sheet No. R/KRE/2024/38 prepared by Ratnapura Survey Superintendent situated in Matuwagala Grama Niladhari Division of Kiriella Divisional Secretary's Division of Uda Paththuwa of Kuruwita Korale of Ratnapura District of Sabaragamuwa Province.\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba - 2025.09.12 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.09.2025\n\nAMENDMENT THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNOTICE UNDER SECTION 7.\n\nIN accordance with Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2104/32 and dated 04.01.2019 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I hereby amend the notice under Section 7 by including in the notice under the said Section 7, the land parcel bearing 256 measuring 0.0141 hectare in addition to the land parcels bearing 251, 253,255\u201a 258, 260 and 261 having a total area of 0.0457\n\nhectare shown on Cadastral Map No. 520001, Block No. 40, Sheet No. 08 shown in page 14A of the notice. B. A. D. CHINTHAKA, Divisional Secretary, Homagama. Homagama Divisional Secretariat, 10th of September 2025. EOG 09 - 0098\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
