    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.12PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.09.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2453/39 \u2013 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 12 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0286\u00fd\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.09.12No. 2453/39\u2013 FRIDAY, SEPTEMBER 12, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nAllotments of land depicted in below names and extents in the Advance Tracing No. CO/MRT/2018/04 dated 23.01.2018 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Katubedda village of Salpiti Korale, Palle Pathuwa Minor Division in Moratuwa Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division, Colombo District, Western Province:\n\n01. Lot A - Extent: 0.0729 Hectare North: Sri Rahula Mawatha and Battery Watta alias Delgaha Watta claimed by P.G. Anil; East: Battery Watta alias Delgaha Watta claimed by Mr. P.G. Anil and claimant cannot be found; South: Lot B, and Sri Rahula Maha Vidyalaya claimed by State; West: Sapugaha Watta claimed by Thennakoon Mudiyanselage Warnarathna & others.\n\n02. Lot B - Delgahawatta alias Battery Watta, Asst. No. 366, Sri Rahula Mawatha - Extent: 1.3942 Hectare North: Lot A and Battery Watta alias Delgahawatta claimant cannot be found; East: Bolgoda River; South: Cement drain, Dandeniya Watta claimed by State, Access road and Lot C; West: Lot C.\n\n03. Lot C - Extent: 0.0735 Hectare North: Lot A and B; East: Lot B and Access road; South: Access road and cut drain; West: Cut drain and Sri Rahula Maha Vidyalaya claimed by State."
