ority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - PG 7246 - 64 (09/2025)\n\n02. Lot No. 04 Name of the Land: Assessment No. 129/11, Colombo Road; Description of Land : Garden together with mixed cultivation about 40-50 years old; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Sitthy Fareena Razik: 0.0120 Hectare."
