    "chunk_text": "47. Lot No. 50 Name of the Land: Eriyagahamula Hena, Assessment No. 73/A, Colombo Road; Description of Land : Home Garden together with a part of permanent two story building roofed with tiles; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: B. M. C. Bandaranayake; Extent: 0.0002 Hectare.\n\nroofed with roofing Sheets; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: D. M. Bandaranayake; Extent: 0.0005 Hectare.\n\nI hereby give notice to the public that every person interested in the said land/servitude which is to be acquired is informed to appear personally or by agent duly authorized in writing before me on 29th October 2025 at 10.00 am at the Divisional Secretariat of Kandy Four Gravets and Gangawata Korale.\n\nThe nature of their interests in the land/lands, the particulars of their claim for compensation, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount should be notified to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 22nd October, 2025.\n\nH. M. U. B. Herath, Divisional Secretary, Kandy Four Gravets and Gangawata Korale. At the Divisional Secretariat, Kandy Four Gravets and Gangawata Korale, 03rd September, 2025.\n\nEOG 09 - 0111"
  },
