    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.13PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 13.09.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2453/46 \u2013 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 13 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dd9\u0dc3\u0db1\u0288\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.09.13No. 2453/46 \u2013 SATURDAY, SEPTEMBER 13, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are required for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nAll that allotments of lands depicted in the Advanced Tracing No. R/GDK/2022/26 dated 22.08.2024, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Rakwana (F.V.P. 699) in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 231/C of Rakwana South in Atakalan Korale Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Godakawela, in the District of Ratnapura, Sabaragamuwa Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Eberfoil Watta, Ewertan Watta and Kabaragala Mukalana \u2013 Extent: 233.1326 Hectares North: Lot No. 167, Lot H in FVP 699, Lot No. 482, Lot G, F in Tracing, Lot No. 168 in FVP 699, Lot E, D in FVP, Lot\n\nNo. 171, Lot C, D in Tracing and Lot No. 67 in FVP 699 ; East: Lot Nos. 482, 67, 184, 341, 284 and 626 in FVP 699; South: Lot Nos. 482, 341, 282, 626, 632, 176 and 167 in FVP 699; West: Lot Nos. 176, 167 and Lot H in FVP 699.\n\n02. Lot \u2018B\u2019 \u2013 Eberfoil Watta, Ewertan Watta and Kabaragala Mukalana \u2013 Extent: 0.5469 Hectare North: Lot No. 482 in FVP 699; East: Lot No. 482 in FVP 699 and Lot A in Tracing; South: Lot A; West: Lot A and Lot Nos. 482 in FVP 699."
