    "chunk_text": "1AIV (\u0d85) \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.15PART IV (A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 15.09.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2454/02 \u2013 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 15 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dc3\u01ff\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.09.15\n\nNo. 2454/02 \u2013 MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 15, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (A) \u2013 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nProvincial Councils Noti\ufb01cations\n\nSOUTHERN PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nCo-operative Societies Statue, No. 06 of 2019 of the Southern Province Provincial Council Orders on Delegation of Powers\n\nSINCE the Southern Provincial Council has been dissolved, the powers vested in the Minister in charge of the subject of Co-operatives of the Southern Provincial Council by Section 2.(4) of the Co-operative Societies Statute No. 06 of 2019 of the Southern Province Provincial Council, have been assigned to me by Article 154 (C) of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka and in terms of such powers, I, Madduma Kankanamalage Bandula Harischandra, the Governor of the Southern Province, hereby delegate all powers mentioned in column III of the schedule below, which are vested in the Commissioner Registrar of Co-operative Societies in terms of the Co-operative Societies Statue No. 06 of 2019 of the Southern Province Provincial Council and the rules made there under, and all powers mentioned in column III that are not inconsistent with the Co-operative Societies (Amendment) Act No. 05 of 1972 read with the preamble of the said Co-operative Societies Statute, to the person mentioned in column I of the schedule below to assist the Commissioner of Co-operative Development of the Southern Province, from the date mentioned in column II of the said schedule.\n\nM\u0d7a\u0d7d\u0d7d\u0d8e\u0d86\u0d7a K\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d84\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d7a\u0d86\u0d7a\u0d85\u0d7a\u0d80\u0d7e B\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d8e\u0d85\u0d7a H\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d82\u0d8c\u0d7c\u0d81\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d8b\u0d7a Governor, Southern Province.\n\nSouthern Province Governor\u2019s Secretariat,At Galle,On the 29th day August 2025."
  },
