i Lanka and in terms of such powers, do hereby exclude Section 6.ii (C) and chart No.01 of schedule (A) of orders of the Co-operative Employees\u2019 Pension Statute No.02 of 2019 and substitute thereof with the following section and chart No. 01 and the said set of orders are amended and enacted. These orders shall be effective from 01.04.2024.\n\nMadduma Kankanamalage Bandula Harischandra, Governor, Southern Province.\n\nAt the Southern Province Governor\u2019s Secretariat, Lower Dickson Road, GalleOn this 28 day of August 2025,\n\n06.ii"
