    "chunk_text": "1AIV (\u0d85) \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.17PART IV (A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 17.09.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2454/35\u2013 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 17 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.09.17\n\nNo. 2454/35 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 17, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (A) \u2013 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nProvincial Councils Noti\ufb01cations\n\nDELEGATION OF POWERS UNDER CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES STATUTE OF THE\n\nWESTERN PROVINCIAL COUNCIL No. 03 OF 1998\n\nI, Hanif Yusoof, the Governor of the Western Province, according to the powers vested upon me under the Section 02(2) of the Co-operative Societies Statute of Western Provincial Council No. 03 of 1998: that shall be read with the Act, 154(c) of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, hereby notify that powers speci\ufb01 ed under the Column III of its schedule will be delegated to the post holder mentioned in Column II, corresponding to the name of Column I in the following schedule, that is appointed to assist the Commissioner of Co-operative Development of Western Province and the Registrar of Co-operative Societies of the Western Province with e\ufb00 ect from 01.08.2025.\n\nH\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d82\u0d7f Y\u0d8e\u0d8c\u0d88\u0d88\u0d7f, Governor, Western Province.\n\nAt the O\ufb03 ce of the Governor of Western Province,Located at the Western Provincial Council Building,Battaramulla.on the 12th day of September 2025.\n\n1A \u2013 PG 7249 \u2013 07 (09/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nIV (\u0d85) \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.17\n\nPART IV (A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 17.09.2025 2A\n\nSchedule I\n\nColumn I Column II Column III"
