    "chunk_text": "1AIV (\u0d85) \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.17PART IV (A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 17.09.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2454/36 \u2013 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 17 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.09.17\n\nNo. 2454/36 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 17, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (A) \u2013 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nProvincial Councils Noti\ufb01cations\n\nWESTERN PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nI, Hanif Yusuf, the Governor of the Western Province, do hereby announce that according to the powers vested in me as per Sub-section (1) of Section 38 of the Rent Act No. 07 of 1972 read with Section 02 of the Provincial Councils (Consequential Provisions) Act No. 12 of 1989, I have decided that there shall be II Rent Boards within the Western Province and the Local Government Authority Area / Local Government Authority Areas relevant to each Rent Board set out in Column I of the Schedule heretounder has been set out correspondingly in Column II of the said Schedule and the place where each such Rent Board is conducted should be as depicted in Column III thereof. It is hereby further announced that the order published in Provincial Councils Section in Part IV(A) in No. 1561 dated 01.08.2008 be annulled hereby and this announcement shall take e\ufb00 ect from 01st of September 2025.\n\nH\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d82\u0d7f Y\u0d8e\u0d8c\u0d8e\u0d7f Governor, Western Province.\n\nAt Battaramulla,On the 01st day September 2025.\n\n1A \u2013 PG 7250 \u2013 07 (09/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nIV (\u0d85) \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.17\n\nPART IV (A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 17.09.2025 2A\n\nSchedule\n\nRent BoardRelevant Local GovernmentAuthority AreaPlace where the o\ufb03 ce is conducted\n\n01. Colombo District\n\n(i) Colombo Rent BoardColombo Municipal Council areaColombo Municipal Council"
