    "chunk_text": "I do hereby grant permission to the Chief Secretary and the Accounting Officers of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council to disburse as per the Second Supplementary Financial Statement for the year 2025, by virtue of powers vested in me under Section 27 (a) of the Provincial Council Act No. 42 of 1987, as the term of the 06th Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka ended on 26th September, 2017.\n\nThis permission will be valid till 31st of December, 2025 or upto the date that expires three months (03) from the date of summoning the Seventh (07th) Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council or from the date re-start the functions of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council which occurs first.\n\nA. A. C. J. Rajarathna,Hon. Governor, Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council.30th day of July, 2025.\n\nEOG 09 - 0169/3\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'09'17Part IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 17.09.202510A\n\nAUTHORIZATION\n\nFOR 2025 ADVANCED ACCOUNTS\n\nI do hereby approve the amend the advance account limits for the year 2025 stated in the Sixth schedule of the Second Supplementary Financial Statement for the year 2025, by virtue of powers vested in me under Section 27 (a) of the Provincial Council Act No. 42 of 1987, as the term of the 06th Sabaragamuwa Provincial Councilof the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka ended on 26th September, 2017.\n\nAccordingly, I do hereby grant permission to the Chief Secretary and the Accounting Officers of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council to bear the expenses subject to those limits.\n\nA. A. C. J. Rajarathna,Hon. Governor, Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council.\n\n30th day of July, 2025.\n\nEOG 09 - 0169/4\n\n____________________________\n\nAUTHORIZATION\n\nFOR 2024 ADVANCED ACCOUNTS"
