ue, Colombo 3, of the Second Part, on this 14th day of July, Two Thousand and Twenty-Three witnessed as follows:-\n\n1. TITLE\n\nThis Agreement shall be known as the Plantations Maintenance & Support Sta\ufb00 Collective Agreement.\n\n2. EMPLOYERS COVERED AND BOUND"
