    "chunk_text": "All Employees on Completion of 15 Years' Service Placed on Grade IRs.29,000RS.875.00\n\nEOG 09 - 0172\n\n__________________________________________\n\nMy No.: id.s$j;=$6$2023.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131\n\nH.M.D.N.K. W\u0d7a\u0d8d\u0d7a\u0d85\u0d82\u0d92\u0d7a\u0d7d\u0d7d\u0d7a, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDepartment of Labour.Labour Secretariat,Colombo 05, 02nd day of September, 2025.\n\nCollective Agreement No. 36(3) of 2023\n\nCOLLECTIVE AGREEMENT - SUPERVISORY STAFF\n\nThis Collective Agreement made and entered into between The Janatha Estates Development Board, No. 55/75 Vauxhall Lane, Colombo 2 of the First Part and the Ceylon Estate Sta\ufb00 s' Union of No. 6, Aloe Avenue, Colombo 3, of the Second Part, on this 14th day of July, Two Thousand and Twenty Three witnessed as follows:-\n\n1. TITLE\n\nThis Agreement shall be known as the Plantations Supervisory Sta\ufb00 Collective Agreement.\n\nI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'09'17P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 17.09.2025 11A\n\n2. EMPLOYERS COVERED AND BOUND\n\nThis Agreement shall bind the management of Janatha Estates Development Board, whose name is mentioned as \ufb01 rst part for and in respect of the categories of employees hereinafter described in Clause 3 hereof.\n\n3. UNION AND EMPLOYEES COVERED AND BOUND\n\nThis Agreement shall cover and bind the aforesaid Trade Union, hereinafter referred to as the Union, and members of the said Union who are employed by Janatha Estates Development Board on monthly contracts of employment and in respect of categories of employees given in Schedule I, hereon.\n\n4. EARLIER AGREEMENTS"
