    "chunk_text": "1AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.17PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 17.09.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2454/42 \u2013 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 17 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.09.17\n\nNo. 2454/42 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 17, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Noti\ufb01cations\n\n1A \u2013 G 045398 \u2013 11 (09/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nMy No.: \u0dc3\u0dcf\u0119/\u0dc0\u01b1/6/2023\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT - (CHAPTER 131)\n\nTHE Collective Agreement entered into between Janatha Estates Development Board - No. 55/75, Vauxhall Lane, Colombo 02 of the one part and the Ceylon Estate Staffs\u2019 Union - No. 06, Aloe Avenue, Colombo 03 of the other part on 14th July 2023 is hereby published in terms of Section 06 of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131, of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (Revised Edition 1956).\n\nH.M.D.N.K. WATALIYADDA, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDepartment of Labour,Labour Secretariat,Colombo 05.02nd September, 2025. Collective Agreement No. 36(4) of 2023\n\nI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.17\n\nPART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 17.09.2025 2A\n\nCOLLECTIVE AGREEMENT - MEDICAL STAFF\n\nThis Collective Agreement made and entered into between the Janatha Estates Development Board, No. 55/75 Vauxhall Lane, Colombo 2 of the First Part, and the Ceylon Estate Staffs\u2019 Union of No. 6, Aloe Avenue, Colombo 3 of the Second Part, on this 14th day of July, Two Thousand and Twenty-Three witnessed as follows :-\n\n1. Title.\u2013 This Agreement shall be known as the Plantations Medical Staff Collective Agreement."
