oaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby declare, under Sub - section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act. An allotment of land depicted in the Advanced Tracing No. \u0d9c\u023c/ \u0da2\u0dcf/01/238 dated 27.12.2001 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the Village called Nagoda of Ragam Paththuwa Minor Division in the Deputy Governor\u2019s Division of Ja Ela in Gampaha District of Western Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 01 \u2013 Aniyakandawatta - Extent: 0.0948 Hectare North: Aniyakanda watta claimed by Jerry Peiris and Others; East, South and West: Road.\n\nK.D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMy No.: 13/97/NH/215.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/06,Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.24th July, 2025.\n\nEOG 09 - 0188"
