    "chunk_text": "\u0d85\u0d82\u0d82\u0d9a \u0d85\u0d82\u0d82\u0d9a 2455/042455/04 \u2013 \u2013 20252025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd0\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc3 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd0\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc3 2222 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0db3\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dcf\u0dcf \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0db3\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dcf\u0dcf \u2013 \u2013 2025.09.222025.09.22No. 2455/04 \u2013No. 2455/04 \u2013 MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 22, 2025 MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 22, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERALPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment NotificationsGovernment Notifications\n\nappoint Mr. Wijesooriya Arachchige Jayawickrama, Attorney-at-Law, No.202/B/61, The Villege, Kudamaduwa, Matthegoda to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration.\n\nDr. Anil Jayantha Fernando, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo.16th September, 2025.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/04/2022/112.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON(1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nPublic Service National Health Service Union, Sri Jayawardenapura General Hospital, Thalapathpitiya, Nugegoda\n\nand\n\nSri Jayawardenapura General Hospital Board, Thalapathpitiya, Nugegoda\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013\n\nWhether the 188 orderlies (Attendents) mentioned in Annexure - 01, employed in the Sri Jayawardenapura General Hospital Board have been caused injustice by the steps taken to place them in salary code PL - 1 from 01.01.2006 in accordance with Public Administration Circular 6/2006 and if so, to what relief they are entitled.\n\nH. M. D. N. K. Wataliyadda, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Office of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo, on this 03rd day of September, 2025.\n\nAnnexure 01\n\n1. KDA Kalyani2. M. A. S. Vi