    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2455/05 - 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc3 22 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0db3\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.09.22\n\nNo. 2455/05 \u2013 MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 22, 2025 - 22.09.2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7 I hereby notify that under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act that the Government intends to acquire the following lands which are required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the lands proposed to be obtained :- Allotments of lands called Lots No. 1 to 4 (4 Lots) described below in Zone 1 Sheet 1 plan of Sketch Map 610559 dated 29.10.2024 situated in the Village of Deraniyagala in Grama Niladhari Division of No. 114, Deraniyagala North in minor division of Atulugam Korale East in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Deraniyagala in Kegalle District in Sabaragamuwa Province and bounded as;\n\n01. Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Maligathenna Estate; Present use of the land: Home Garden, a mixed cultivation aged 20-30 years, water tank, a foundation and a part of a permanent building; Claimant: Not found; Extent: 0.3863 Hectare. (0 Acres 3 Roods 32.7 Perches)\n\nOn the North by : Lot No. 1638 of F.V.P. 621; On the East by : Lot No. 1638 of F.V.P. 621 and Lot No. 2 of\n\nthis plan; On the South by : Lot No. 2 and Lot No. 1636 of F.V.P. 621; On the West by : Lot Nos.1636 and 1638 of F.V.P. 621.\n\n02. Lot No. 2 Name of the Land: Maligathenna Estate; Present use of the land: Home Garden, a mixed cultivation aged 20-30 years, a permanent building, and parts of 3 permanent buildings; Claimant: Government; Extent: 0.4640 Hectare. (1 Acre 0 Roods 23.5 Perches)"
