    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2455$08 - 2025 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 22 jeks i`\u00ffod - 2025'09'22No. 2455/08 - MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 22, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A- PG 7258 - 284 (09/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nUNIVERSITIES ACT, No. 16 OF 1978\n\nOrder under Section 27(1) (b) read with Section 25A\n\nBY virtue of powers vested in me by section 27(1 )(b) read with Section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Dr. Harini Amarasuriya, the Minister of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education having obtained a report under Section 70C of the aforesaid Act, in respect of the Nagananda International Institute for Buddhist Studies (Pvt) Limited a company incorporated in Sri Lanka under the Companies Act, No.7 of 2007 and bearing Registration Number PV 94125 and located at Manelwatta, Bollegala, Kelaniya, being recognized as a Degree Awarding Institute do by this Order, amend the Schedule I to the Order made under the said Act, and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1944/2 of December 07, 2015, by the substitution of the contents under the heading \u2018Condition\u2019 in schedule I and schedule II for of the following :-\n\nSCHEDULE I\n\nConditions\n\n1. Nagananda International Institute for Buddhist Studies (Pvt) Limited shall, when admitting students of the degree programme related to the degree Specified in Schedule II hereto in respect of:\n\n(A) Bachelor of Arts in Buddhist Studies with minimum of 90 credits (SLQF Level 5), adhere to the minimum entry qualification of three (03) simple passes (S) in any stream in one and the same sitting at G.C.E. (Advanced Level) Examination conducted by the Department of Examinations of Sri Lanka or equivalent qualification."
