    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.23PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 23.09.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2455/17 \u2013 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 23 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u025e\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.09.23No. 2455/17 \u2013 TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 23, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nO\u0d8b\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b \u0d8e\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 38 (a)\n\nOrder No. 100 of 2025\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/5/2018/HA/15. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: DS/VN/LA.A/VITHTHAGAPURAM. By virtue of the powers vested in me by the Order under Section 38 (a) of the Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby direct the Acquiring O\ufb03 cer or any other o\ufb03 cer authorized by him referred to in Paragraph 1 of the Schedule to take possession of the land speci\ufb01 ed in the corresponding entry in Paragraph 2 of that Schedule.\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/6,Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.11th September, 2025.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Acquiring O\ufb03 cer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Valikamam North, Thellippalai.\n\n2. Description of the Land.\u2013 An allotment of land depicted below in the Plan No. PP \u0dba\u0dcf 2921, dated 31.01.2020 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the village called Thellippalai South West in No. 223, Vithahapuram Grama Niladhari Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Valikamam North (Thellippalai) in Ja\ufb00 na District of Northern Province and bounded as follows:"
