    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2022'06'27PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 06.27.2023 1A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2455/ 24 - 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 25 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.09.25\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2455/ 24 - 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 25 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.09.25No. 2455/24 \u2013 THURSDAY, SEPTEMBER 25, 2025\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT(CHAPTER 460)Declaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation hereby declare under Sub section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nAllotment of the Land situated in Village of Beverly in the Grama Niladhari Division of Kiriweldola - 241 A, in the Divisional Secretary's Devision of Kotapola of Matara District in the Southern Province, depicted in Surveyor General's Tracing Number MR/KTP/2019/552 and dated 09.12.2024 and boundaries of Land given below.\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Goshan Waththa alias Manikkawaththa, \u2013 Extent: About 4.5000 Hectares\n\nNorth: Sinharaja Preservation and Ela; East: Ela and Goshan Estate which is claiming over by Union Bank PLC; South: Ela and Goshan Estate which is claiming over by Union Bank PLC and Sinharaja Preservation; West : Sinharaja Preservation. K.D. L\u0d7a\u0d85 K\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7a, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/3/2019/FR/263.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, \u201cMihikatha Medura,\u201d No. 1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.24th July, 2025.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A \u2013 G 045440 \u2013 19(09/2025)PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
