    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.12PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.09.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2456/05 \u2013 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 29 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dc3\u01ff\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.09.29No. 2456/05\u2013 MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 29, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nAn portion of land in the name and extent mentioned below and depicted in Advanced Tracing No: MAHA/PNW/2013/1277-B dated 28.07.2013 prepared by the Senior Superintend of Surveys for Surveyor situated in the village called Beddegama, in the D.R.O\u2019s Division of Pallegampaha Palispattu Korale West in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Panwila in Kandy District of the Central Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot A - Batagala Division - Extent: 9.3077 Hectare North: The canel the Batagala Division claimed by the State; East: The Batagala Division claimed by the State and the canel; South:The cane, the road and the Batagala Division claimed by the State Plantation Cooperation; West:\n\nThe Batagala Division claimed by the State Plantation Cooperation and the canel.\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation.\n\nMy No.: 13/97/FR/330.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.23rd July, 2025.\n\nEOG 09 \u2013 0244\n\n1A \u2013 G045448 \u2013 24 (09/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
