    "chunk_text": "Administrative District Special Mediation Board Areas Date of Vacation of PostMulathivu Mulathivu District 01.03.2023Ampara Ampara District 01.03.2023Colombo Colombo District 01.10.2025 Rathnapura Rathnapura District 01.10.2025Kurunegala Kurunegala District 01.10.2025 Polonnaruwa Polonnaruwa District 01.10.2025 02. The Mediation Boards Commission hereby gives notice calling nominations upon (A) the Individuals, (B) the Bodies, Organizations and Institutions of non political nature, and (C) the District Secretaries/ Divisional Secretaries specified hereinafter under 02 (II) to submit names of person who are eligible under 02 (I) for appointment as Mediators to the Panel of Mediators for the said Special Mediation Board area:\n\n(I) The following Persons are entitled to be appointed to the Panel of a particular Special Mediation Board Area whose names may be so submitted for appointment.\n\n(a) A person eligible to be appointed as a Member of the Panel of Mediators in respect of the Special Mediation Boards shall be between 35 to 70 years of age and; (b) has any professional qualification obtained from a recognized professional body established by or under any written law; (c) has been or is public officer.\n\n(II) (A) The following Individuals are entitled to submit nominations other than themselves for appointment to the Panel of a particular Special Mediation Board area: (i) A Public Officer or a Provincial Public Officer serving as the Head of a Department or as the Regional Head of a Department in an office located within the Administrative District at which that particular Special Mediation Board area is situated: (ii) A Head of a Place or religious worship or of school situated in that particular Special\n\nMediation Board area; (iii) A retired Head of a Department or School principal residing in that particular Special"
